Error handling and recovery mechanisms should be implemented based on your specific requirements, such as retrying failed data fetch operations or gracefully handling exceptions when processing the data.

For performance tuning and debugging, you can add additional logging statements as needed in different parts of your pipeline to monitor various metrics, such as memory usage, processing time, and data throughput.']

