The function manages system dependencies by checking if the process has the necessary privileges to perform DNS lookups and handles cases where the privileges are insufficient by returning an appropriate error code. It is designed for high-concurrency environments, ensuring thread safety and efficient resource utilization through the use of mutexes for both individual queries and the rate limiter.']

